  id: reedstalk
  dexNumber: 125
  displayName: Reedstalk
  lore: A grey heron on stilt legs that stands so still the reeds grow round it.
    It moves exactly once, and by then the fish is gone.
  personality: Aloof, precise, judges your posture.
